    "intro": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "text_pxhfpD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Grunt Style Foundation is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit dedicated to providing life-changing resources and experiences that help Service Members, Veterans, First Responders, and their families thrive. Focused on mental health, wellness and advocacy, the Foundation ensures those who have served—and continue to serve—receive the recognition, honor, and support they deserve.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "text_pxhfpD"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "section_visibility": "always",
        "desktop_content_position": "center",
        "content_alignment": "center",
        "color_scheme": "scheme-1",
        "full_width": true,
        "padding_top": 32,
        "padding_bottom": 16
      }
    },
    "impact": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "image_with_text_wET9xm": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CPB_M_980x600__10.png",
            "title": "ADVOCACY",
            "text": "<p>Our <em>War Cry for Change: A Revolution to Reclaim Veteran Mental Health </em>initiative advocates for systemic reform in veteran mental healthcare by challenging the harmful over prescription of antidepressants, benzodiazepines, and antipsychotics while championing access to safer, alternative healing modalities.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_4dWj3m": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CPB_M_980x600__11.png",
            "title": "MENTAL HEALTH",
            "text": "<p>Because the best support network for veterans is other veterans, we bring a community of warriors together through therapeutic events across the country through Irreverent Warriors. We also work with other veteran organizations who provide services such as job placement, training, housing, service dogs and more.</p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "image_with_text_kCegTn": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "icon": "none",
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/CPB_M_980x600__9_2b4ca9b6-fda0-45a8-8b4b-a5158a9ddfce.png",
            "title": "WELLNESS",
            "text": "<p>Grunt Style Foundation integration retreats provide life-changing resources and experiences to Service Members, Veterans and First Responders allowing them to thrive in all aspects of life. </p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "image_with_text_wET9xm",
