            "text": "<p><strong>Grunt Style Foundation Giveback Tees<br/><br/></strong>When you purchase a <strong>Grunt Style Foundation</strong> shirt, <strong>all profits</strong> are donated to the <strong>Grunt Style Foundation</strong>, a 501(c)(3) nonprofit organization.</p>"
